		{
			"id":"c9581624fc2813bb",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## Scared Land 6P\n*Old wars and the fall of stellar debris have pocked this ground with craters turning it into death maze of rock and dust.*",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1999,
			"y":-47,
			"width":260,
			"height":198
		},
