		{"id":"c520d4d11ac7a62c","type":"text","text":"## Silent Desolation 4P\n### Maelstrom\n*Dry sand and bare rock are the only monuments that will stand over the graves of those that fall in battle here.*","x":1121,"y":874,"width":284,"height":218},
		{"id":"4577231ef2ad8f45","type":"file","file":"Media/Silent Desolation 4P match.png","x":725,"y":874,"width":397,"height":400},
		{"id":"d02231cd15672f6e","type":"file","file":"Media/Hivehold 4P.png","x":722,"y":-946,"width":400,"height":396},
		{"id":"3a91e3d82590802b","type":"file","file":"Media/Frosthold 6P.png","x":1599,"y":-946,"width":400,"height":265},
		{"id":"0184ae5ee3241de3","type":"file","file":"Media/Silent Desolation 4P lobby.png","x":323,"y":874,"width":399,"height":400},
		{"id":"96d4774d2eea76df","type":"text","text":"## Hivehold 4P\n### Domination","x":1122,"y":-946,"width":193,"height":89},
		{"id":"0a754702694f8a4e","type":"text","text":"## Frosthold 6P","x":1999,"y":-946,"width":250,"height":50},
		{"id":"cfb09d52deb827f5","type":"file","file":"Media/Last Stand.png","x":2590,"y":-946,"width":400,"height":394},
		{
			"id":"2b287ea0ed6e5902",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## The Crucible of Blood\n*Last Stand*",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2990,
			"y":-946,
			"width":339,
			"height":80
		},
		{"id":"fb35656e69199fa4","type":"text","text":"## Reaper's Crossing 2P","x":-105,"y":526,"width":301,"height":60},
		{
			"id":"a60267444ab198c5",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## Edge of desolation\n*A dead manufactorum amongst the tangle of ravines promises shelter to armies that come to this forsaken place.*",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-105,
			"y":1214,
			"width":260,
			"height":202
		},
		{
			"id":"abbf1f674424311a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## Withered Marsh 2P\n*The deserts have grown here, eating the scrub grass and swamp lands and shrouding it with dust and sand.*",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-105,
			"y":1505,
			"width":281,
			"height":400
		},
		{"id":"ebed7ac8ff56f8b9","type":"text","text":"## ?? 2P","x":-105,"y":874,"width":250,"height":60},
		{
			"id":"36a63529e8a6953e",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## Impact Zone\n*The smouldering remains of stellar debris still glow in the depths of the crater left by their fall from the heavens.*",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-105,
			"y":2058,
			"width":260,
			"height":198
		},
		{"id":"c7e9ef7582a9ce00","type":"text","text":"## Cinder's Pit 2P\n*Dust blows through the jagged rocks of this ravine, burying the bones of those that made war here in the past and promising the same to those who come here now.*","x":-120,"y":58,"width":250,"height":398},
		{"id":"37b14d59d0ac7ba6","type":"text","text":"## Blighted Mire 2P\n","x":-120,"y":-427,"width":250,"height":397},
		{"id":"5c99dbe17fae1326","type":"text","text":"## Glacier's Ridge 2P\n\n*A wide expanse of snow and\nice spills down from the\njagged base of a glacier to\nthe remains of an industrial\noutpost at its edge.*","x":-120,"y":-946,"width":265,"height":400},
