		{"id":"1da334d8b53719e0","type":"file","file":"Maps Of Content/Lobby Settings.md","subpath":"#COMBAT","x":-1459,"y":-499,"width":400,"height":1876},
		{"id":"527251b456347deb","type":"text","text":"## Manufactorum","x":-1445,"y":-746,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"ba136234c4052626","type":"text","text":"## Machine District","x":-1445,"y":-823,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"8178b19e3cafce7d","type":"file","file":"Media/Sinking City.png","x":-505,"y":2302,"width":398,"height":400},
		{
			"id":"89a586742576b6fa",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## Enduring Citadel\n*Long ago, the Emperor's angels of death raised this citadel to watch over the land. Now its walls echo again to the sounds of war.*",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-94,
			"y":2830,
			"width":260,
			"height":226
		},
		{"id":"f15d2b28352602c9","type":"file","file":"Maps Of Content/Lobby Settings.md","subpath":"#ECONOMY","x":-1859,"y":-499,"width":400,"height":2296},
